---
// CareerTimeline.astro - 2x2 Interlocking Architectural Hairline Grid
---

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-border-light dark:bg-border-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
  
  <!-- Cell 1: Huawei Digital Power (Sept 2026–present) -->
  <article class="bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-7">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs space-y-0.5">
          <span class="text-accent-dark dark:text-accent font-semibold block">Sept 2026 — Present</span>
          <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted block">Mexico &amp; LATAM</span>
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/logos/huawei-digital-power.svg" 
          alt="Huawei Digital Power" 
          class="h-6 w-auto max-w-[145px] object-contain block dark:brightness-110 shrink-0" 
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 pt-1">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Executive Solutions Sales Manager — Utility PV &amp; BESS
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Leading technical sales, pre-sales architecture, and solution design for utility-scale solar PV and battery energy storage infrastructure at Huawei Digital Power—bridging power electronics, grid integration, and field engineering with commercial strategy across Mexico and LATAM.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted flex items-center justify-between">
      <span>Utility-Scale Solar &amp; Storage</span>
      <span>Pre-Sales &amp; Grid Architecture</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Cell 2: LATNOVVA (Oct 2025–Aug 2026) -->
  <article class="bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-7">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs space-y-0.5">
          <span class="text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark font-medium block">Oct 2025 — Aug 2026</span>
          <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted block">Mexico</span>
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/logos/latnovva.png" 
          alt="LATNOVVA" 
          class="h-5 w-auto max-w-[130px] object-contain block dark:brightness-110 shrink-0" 
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2 pt-1">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Technical Operations &amp; Advisory
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Strategic technical advisory and field operations across utility-scale Solar PV and BESS. Bridged engineering design, EPC execution, and long-term asset reliability—helping project owners and operators ensure complex electrical systems perform reliably under real operating conditions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted flex items-center justify-between">
      <span>Technical Operations</span>
      <span>EPC &amp; Owner Advisory</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Cell 3: Sungrow Power (2020–2025) -->
  <article class="bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-7">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs space-y-0.5">
          <span class="text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark font-medium block">2020 — 2025</span>
          <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted block">North LATAM</span>
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/logos/sungrow.png" 
          alt="Sungrow Power" 
          class="h-5 w-auto max-w-[130px] object-contain block shrink-0" 
        />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-1">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Field Engineering → Service Lead → LATAM Center of Expertise
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Started in the field commissioning central inverters and battery storage across Latin America, personally delivering site acceptance testing (SAT) for over 800 MW of PV and early BESS installations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Evolved into leading the regional Field Service organization across North LATAM (2.1+ GW solar, ~60 MWh BESS) and establishing the LATAM Center of Expertise (CoE) to centralize Tier-3 R&amp;D investigations and regional engineer certification.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted flex items-center justify-between">
      <span>800+ MW SAT · 2.1+ GW Fleet</span>
      <span>Regional CoE &amp; Tier-3 RCA</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Cell 4: Field Foundation (2008–2020) -->
  <article class="bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-7 sm:p-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-7">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs space-y-0.5">
