          <span class="text-ink-light-muted dark:text-ink-dark-muted block">Argentina · Venezuela · Mexico</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0">
          <img src="/logos/vector.png" alt="Vector Renewables" class="w-5 h-5 object-contain rounded" title="Vector Renewables" />
          <img src="/logos/slb.svg" alt="SLB" class="h-3.5 w-auto max-w-[40px] object-contain dark:invert" title="SLB (Schlumberger)" />
          <img src="/logos/ypf.png" alt="YPF S.A." class="h-3.5 w-auto max-w-[38px] object-contain" title="YPF S.A." />
          <img src="/logos/america-movil.svg" alt="América Móvil" class="h-3.5 w-auto max-w-[52px] object-contain dark:brightness-200" title="América Móvil" />
          <img src="/logos/corpodomotica.svg" alt="Corpodomotica" class="h-3.5 w-auto max-w-[58px] object-contain" title="Corpodomotica" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-1">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-light dark:text-ink-dark">
          Field Foundation: Asset Management, Oil &amp; Gas &amp; Control Systems
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Managed a 400+ MW solar asset portfolio at Vector Renewables, monitoring SCADA performance and plant availability before moving full-time into utility OEM engineering.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] text-ink-light-secondary dark:text-ink-dark-secondary leading-[1.72]">
          Earlier foundation spans wireline operations in oil &amp; gas in Argentina and Venezuela (YPF S.A., Schlumberger), telecom infrastructure (América Móvil), and embedded control systems design (Corpodomotica).
        </p>
